flowchart TD
 Route[Route definition] --> Guard[Web/session middleware]
 Guard --> Request[Form Request validation]
 Request --> Controller[Controller action]
 Controller --> Model[Eloquent model]
 Model --> Query[Database query]
 Controller --> Storage[Optional filesystem operation]
 Controller --> Response[Redirect or Inertia response]
 Response --> Page[Vue page]
 Page --> Browser[Browser rendering]
